.\" Assisted-by: Claude Code:claude-sonnet-5-5
.Dd November 19, 2026
.Dt JOTAIN 7
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm jotain
.Nd GNU Emacs 31 configuration with a Nix build layer
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Ql just run-built
.Op Ar args
.Pp
.Ql just build | check | test | fmt | update
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Jotain is Finnish for
.Dq something .
It is a GNU Emacs 31 configuration with a Nix build layer.
The floor is Emacs 31.1.
No framework such as Doom or Spacemacs lies underneath.
Nix builds the editor, and binary-cache parity is an invariant.
Modular Emacs Lisp configures it:
.Pa early-init.el ,
.Pa init.el
and one
.Pa lisp/init-*.el
file for each concern.
.Pp
The Nix expressions are
.Pa flake.nix ,
.Pa emacs.nix ,
.Pa overlay.nix ,
.Pa default.nix ,
.Pa module.nix
and
.Pa module-system.nix .
Overlay
.Pa nix/mk-overlay.nix
assembles the distribution, and
.Pa nix/checks.nix
holds the flake checks.
The flake takes
.Ql nixpkgs ,
.Ql emacs-overlay
and
.Ql treefmt-nix
as inputs, and
.Pa flake.lock
pins them.
The only supported system is
.Ql x86_64-linux ,
and the only build is the pgtk GUI.
.Pp
The development shell has tooling only: linters, language servers and the
documentation toolchain.
Enter it with
.Ql nix develop
or
.Ql nix-shell .
It has no Emacs.
Command
.Ql just run-built
builds the distribution and starts it with this configuration,
isolated from
.Pa ~/.emacs.d .
.Sh INSTALLATION
The flake exposes the full distribution
.Pq Emacs, its packages and the tree-sitter grammars ,
a bare
.Ql emacs ,
the Info manual
.Ql info ,
a Home Manager module with the
.Ql services.jotain
daemon, and a NixOS module.
The daemon runs under systemd and is managed with
.Ql jotctl .
The installation page of the website describes each way.
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Pa init.el , Pa early-init.el
The entry points.
.It Pa lisp/
The feature modules, loaded from
.Pa init.el
in order.
.It Pa test/
The ERT suite.
See
.Xr jotain-testing 7 .
.It Pa docs/
The sources of the website and of the Info manual.
Page
.Pa docs/jotain-review-tools.7
compares Emacs review packages, and
.Pa docs/design/
and
.Pa docs/reviews/
hold design notes and dated reports.
.It Pa jotain.7
This page.
.It Pa website/
The shell of the documentation site.
Command
.Ql just site
builds the whole site.
.It Pa etc/
The debug harness, the vendored elisp-doc and the language-evaluation registry.
.It Pa AGENTS.md
The contributor guide: structure, commands, style and architecture notes.
.El
.Sh ONLINE
The documentation site is at
.Lk https://page.jylhis.com/jotain/ .
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Pa /docs/
The documentation index.
.It Pa /manual/
The manual, one page for each chapter, and
.Pa /manual/jotain.info
as an Info file.
Read the Info file in Emacs with
.Ql C-h i d m Jotain RET .
.It Pa /man/
This page and the Emacs man pages.
.It Pa /info/emacs/ , Pa /info/elisp/
The GNU Emacs manual and the Emacs Lisp reference manual, from the Emacs source
revision that Jotain builds.
.It Pa /options/
The reference of the Nix module options.
.It Pa /help/packages/
Every Emacs package that Jotain ships, and the reason it is there.
.El
